("Striker / Defender / Controller / Leader (party roles)","4e_edition",FALSE,"damage-focused / protection-focused / battlefield-control / support roles","4th Edition (2008) party-role taxonomy. Persists in optimizer folksonomy but is not 5e official vocabulary. Internal-eval / JOIN use only; translate before any deliverable."),
("Brute (monster role)","4e_edition",FALSE,"high-hit-point, low-accuracy aggressive monster profile","4th Edition monster role. Useful internal shorthand for encounter / eHP modeling; not 5e official vocabulary. Translate before any deliverable.");
